### Rejected requests. All 422 except the last three, which are 400/404 because
### (AI Generayed) the request could not be parsed or routed at all - validation never ran.
### None of these should reach the bank: `docker compose logs -f bank_simulator`
### should stay silent while this file runs.

### CVV too short -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "12"
}

### CVV not numeric -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "12a"
}

### Card number too short, 13 digits -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Card number with spaces -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222 4053 4324 8877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Expiry month 13 -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 13,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Expiry in the past -> 422, reported against "Expiry"
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 1,
  "expiryYear": 2020,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Two-digit expiry year - reads as year 26, so it is in the past -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 26,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Unsupported currency -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Amount of zero -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 0,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Empty body -> 422 listing all six fields at once
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Three rules broken at once -> 422 with three errors
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "nope",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "amount": 100,
  "cvv": "12"
}

### Malformed JSON -> 400, not 422: it could not be parsed
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",

### Wrong type for amount -> 400: binding failed before validation
POST {{host}}/api/Payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "2222405343248877",
  "expiryMonth": 4,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": "one hundred",
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Malformed GUID in the path -> 404: the {id:guid} route constraint rejects it
GET {{host}}/api/Payments/not-a-guid
